    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάλλομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ᾰλοῦμαι</span>: aor.
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αλόμενος</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αλάμενος</span> (both readings in <i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>HG</u>
			4.5.7
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap
			down</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ ἵππου, ἀπ᾽
			ὄχθων</span>, Id. l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς τοῦ τείχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					14.5
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>: metaph., of a storm, <i>rush down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαλλομένη ἰοειδέα πόντον ὀρίνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.298
				</span></i>
			; of convulsions, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.624
			</span></i>.</div>
